  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/209360706-fd754887-5249-4873-a1b4-f9c3b0b5a05d.png\" width=\"1344\" height=\"740\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/209360715-5abec675-e244-48d7-b54f-0d5ea4a5df1e.png\" width=\"1910\" height=\"71\"></span></p><h3>「生態系大小調整」讓您能透過簡單的設定檔，針對每個維度調整世界生成中的生態系大小。</h3><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span></p><ul>\n<li>支援按維度分別設定</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\">無已知不相容問題，應可與其他尊重世界生成資料包設定的模組共同運作。</span></p>",
